<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35639" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθρῴσκω</span></b> , aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέθορον,</span>
		
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθορον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap in, on,</i> or
			<i>among,</i> c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθορε μέσσῳ
				[ποταμῷ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.233
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθορ᾽ ὁμίλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.623
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡσδὲλέων ἐν βουσὶ θορών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.161
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.381
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρει πῦρ ἐνθορόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθρῴσκει τάφῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					327
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λὰξ ἔνθορεν ἰσχίῳ</span>
			<i>kicked</i> him on the hip, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.233
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λὰξ ἐ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					74.14
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμοις</span>
			Orac.Chald. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				182
			</span></i>.</div>
